{"id":"b681b1b3a348563e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-holder.md","title":"Holder","display":"df-holder — Holder","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-holder","aliases":["58-df-holder"],"display":"df-holder — Holder","depends_on":["[[58-df-holder-continuity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-holder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-holder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-holder — Holder"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"635eb91d8ecbc386\" href=\"?note=635eb91d8ecbc386\" title=\"58-df-holder-continuity\">58-df-holder-continuity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (Hölder 连续谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635eb91d8ecbc386\" href=\"?note=635eb91d8ecbc386\" title=\"58-df-holder-continuity\">58-df-holder-continuity</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holder}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{Holder}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (本文件定义的兼容别名)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder} \\vdash \\mathrm{Holder}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder} \\vdash \\mathrm{Holder}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Hölder continuity condition；两端载体与度量均为显式参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-holder-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"635eb91d8ecbc386","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holder-continuity]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holder-continuity","status":"resolved","id":"635eb91d8ecbc386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (Hölder 连续谓词, see [[58-df-holder-continuity]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Holder}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holder} \\vdash \\mathrm{Holder}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HolderCont}_S(f,X,d_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha)","display":true}],"bytes":677,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-629","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-holder.md|58-df-holder]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["635eb91d8ecbc386"]}